{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/1a8c95fd39cd96a545c050e666fb4e0d.avif?t=1758691240\" width=628 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/81c824e1b93e4af2a210f1ebf94ec09a.poster.avif?t=1758691240\" width=628 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/81c824e1b93e4af2a210f1ebf94ec09a.webm?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/81c824e1b93e4af2a210f1ebf94ec09a.mp4?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A young man named Albert Hartree, or &quot;Al,&quot; suddenly teleports to the unknown planet Voltissia and gains superpowers. Having always admired heroes, he stands up to save its people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely fly across the vast world and take down powerful enemies! A new superhero action game is born.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Superpowers. Your Hero.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/e00d8caef757d9aac1acd7bd780ce56f.poster.avif?t=1758691240\" width=628 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/e00d8caef757d9aac1acd7bd780ce56f.webm?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/e00d8caef757d9aac1acd7bd780ce56f.mp4?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Superpowers and Abilities you acquire will significantly expand your options in both exploration and combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the Calamity on Voltissia!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/8ac0ef8167f3d603bb761317bbc94d7f.poster.avif?t=1758691240\" width=628 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/8ac0ef8167f3d603bb761317bbc94d7f.webm?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/8ac0ef8167f3d603bb761317bbc94d7f.mp4?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Five hundred years ago, a mysterious explosion shattered the world of Voltissia, and with it, civilization. The aftermath changed everything, twisting most of the planet's life into brutal mutants who torment the few remaining survivors, the Enelf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onto this desolate world, a lone young man named Al suddenly appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He decides to join forces with the Enelf and confront the looming threat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2088020?t=1758691240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758691240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/10d55a5e89cd729cb4fdcdfbd70e22e298b7b525/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758691240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/10d55a5e89cd729cb4fdcdfbd70e22e298b7b525/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758691240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Receive Epic MegaGrants!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have received an Epic MegaGrant from Epic Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/EpicMegaGrants.jpg?t=1758691240\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/1a8c95fd39cd96a545c050e666fb4e0d.avif?t=1758691240\" width=628 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/81c824e1b93e4af2a210f1ebf94ec09a.poster.avif?t=1758691240\" width=628 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/81c824e1b93e4af2a210f1ebf94ec09a.webm?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/81c824e1b93e4af2a210f1ebf94ec09a.mp4?t=1758691240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A young man named Albert Hartree, or &quot;Al,&quot; suddenly teleports to the unknown planet Voltissia and gains superpowers. Having always admired heroes, he stands up to save its people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely fly across the vast world and take down powerful enemies! A new superhero action game is born.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Superpowers. Your Hero.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088020/extras/e00d8caef757d9aac1acd7bd780ce56f.poster.avif?t=1758691240\" width=628 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/